    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your end is my beginning.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimah has nothing to live for but her research, and today is the day she reaps the rewards of her labor. \u00a0Little does she know that she will be her first test subject.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short visual novel with exploration and puzzle elements.\u00a0 Story gets dark at times.<br>  <br><strong>Features:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- 20-30 minutes of playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Stylized art with 14 CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- A story someone died for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Turning a light switch off and on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in\u00a011\u00a0days\u00a0for\u00a0the\u00a0RPGMaker\u00a02025\u00a0Gamejam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separate artbook is available if you want to see behind the scenes.\u00a0 (20 pgs long)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your end is my beginning.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimah has nothing to live for but her research, and today is the day she reaps the rewards of her labor. \u00a0Little does she know that she will be her first test subject.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short visual novel with exploration and puzzle elements.\u00a0 Story gets dark at times.<br>  <br><strong>Features:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- 20-30 minutes of playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Stylized art with 14 CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- A story someone died for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Turning a light switch off and on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in\u00a011\u00a0days\u00a0for\u00a0the\u00a0RPGMaker\u00a02025\u00a0Gamejam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separate artbook is available if you want to see behind the scenes.\u00a0 (20 pgs long)</p>",
